# .continue/prompts/form-validation.prompt
---
name: form-validation
description: Create or improve Django form validation
---

Create/improve validation for this form:

{{ input }}

Rules:
- Validate: required, type, max_length, regex, custom business rules
- Use clean_field() for single field validation
- Use clean() for cross-field validation
- Return user-friendly error messages (Spanish for users)
- Prevent SQL injection and XSS

Return complete forms.py with all validations.